<title>INDIA: India HCL HP gets Mahindra contract.</title>
<headline>India HCL HP gets Mahindra contract.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian auto maker Mahindra and Mahindra has awarded a 150-million rupee ($4.1 million) contract to HCL Hewlett-Packward for supply of computer hardware and software, an HCL HP statement said on Friday.</p>
<p>U.S.' Hewlett Packard Company holds 26 percent in HCL HP.</p>
<p>-- New Delhi newsroom +91-11 3-1 2024</p>
</text>
